    <node id="&quot;PORTSMOUTH F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Portsmouth F.C. is a club in the English football league that has signed Turkish midfielder İlker Tugal to a three-year deal."</data>
